sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title: HMAC signing and verification
  participant A as Sender Session
  participant P as Postal Plugin
  participant K as HMAC KV
  participant B as Receiver Session
  participant O as Operator

  Note over A,B: pairing created a pair key
  A->>P: postal_send letter
  P->>K: read current key
  K-->>P: key and keyID
  P->>P: sign v2 payload (keyID, issuedAt, from, to, msgID, kind, taskID, replyTo, letter)
  P->>B: steer signed letter
  B->>P: prompt admission hook
  P->>K: read current and previous
  K-->>P: candidate keys
  alt invalid or stale
    P->>K: write rejected receipt (authenticated reasons only)
    P-->>B: clear body and reason
  else signature valid
    alt kind task
      P->>P: check parent and ancestor
      alt not authorized
        P->>K: write rejected receipt (unauthorized_task)
        P-->>B: clear body + unauthorized_task
      else authorized
        P->>K: write accepted receipt with authorizedBy
        P-->>B: admit letter
      end
    else other kinds
      P->>K: write accepted receipt
      P-->>B: admit letter
    end
  end
  O->>P: postal_rekey
  P->>K: rotate key with grace
  Note over K: old key verifies keyGraceHours
